Liferea is a web feed reader/news aggregator that brings together all
of the content from your favorite subscriptions into a simple interface
that makes it easy to organize and browse feeds. Its GUI is similar to
a desktop mail/newsclient, with an embedded graphical browser.

Liferea 1.14.x is the last version working with webkit2gtk.
Newer version will require webkit2gtk4.1 and libpeas-2 (not available
on SBo due newer library requirement)
